    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d0aa553c4fcbc30",
      "translationZh": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Base（284B / 13B 激活参数，基础版）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6083ce6bbcaaed3",
      "translationZh": "两个指令模型都支持三种推理模式：Non-think（速度快，无思维链）、Think High（在 <think> 块中进行显式推理）和 Think Max（使用专用系统提示词，投入最大的推理力度）。Think Max 要求上下文窗口至少为 384K tokens。所有模式的推荐采样参数均为 temperature=1.0、top_p=1.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e910a0c4dde2ea01",
